@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] administrative-domain-authority
Administrative actions MUST recheck persisted Cedar permissions before projecting
data or mutating state. Internal system authority MUST remain confined to trusted
coordinators; web callers MUST supply their own authenticated account actor.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] administrative-safe-projections
Administrative projections and audit MUST allowlist their fields. Raw Oban
arguments/errors, authentication tokens, credentials and terminal contents MUST
NOT enter browser replies or retained administrative job history.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:capacity] administrative-bounded-reads
Administrative collections MUST use bounded pages and indexed expiry filters.
Expired history MUST be excluded even before physical retention cleanup runs.
